### Complete Workflow: Register → Browse → Add to Cart → Order → Review

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json

###
### STEP 1: REGISTER NEW CUSTOMER
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "workflow@ecommerce.com",
  "username": "workflow_user",
  "password": "Workflow123"
}

### @name registerUser

###
### STEP 2: LOGIN - Get Customer Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "workflow@ecommerce.com",
  "username": "workflow_user",
  "password": "Workflow123"
}

### @name customerLogin
# Copy the 'access_token' value and paste below
@customer_token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIyIiwicm9sZSI6ImN1c3RvbWVyIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc4MzE0MDQ3fQ.__7UUuA-Kcg-1M-aPCwCRuiOZv4JTU3yeKsdgKnEmF0

###
### STEP 3: BROWSE CATEGORIES
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

###
### STEP 4: BROWSE PRODUCTS IN CATEGORY
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1/products

###
### STEP 5: GET PRODUCT DETAILS
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### @name getProduct
# Save product ID
@product_id = 1

###
### STEP 6: SEARCH PRODUCTS
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=laptop&sort_by=price&sort_order=asc

###
### STEP 7: VIEW CART (Auto-creates empty cart)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###
### STEP 8: ADD PRODUCT TO CART (First item)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###
### STEP 9: BROWSE MORE PRODUCTS
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?min_price=500&max_price=1500

###
### STEP 10: ADD ANOTHER PRODUCT TO CART (Second item)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "product_id": 2,
  "quantity": 1
}

###
### STEP 11: VIEW CART WITH ALL ITEMS
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### @name getCartBeforeCheckout
# Save cart item IDs if needed
@cart_item_1 = 1
@cart_item_2 = 2

###
### STEP 12: UPDATE CART ITEM QUANTITY
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/1?quantity=3
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###
### STEP 13: VIEW UPDATED CART
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###
### STEP 14: CHECKOUT - Create Order (ACID Transaction)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### @name checkoutOrder
# Save order ID
@order_id = 

###
### STEP 15: VERIFY CART IS EMPTY AFTER CHECKOUT
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###
### STEP 16: GET ORDER HISTORY
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###
### STEP 17: ATTEMPT REVIEW BEFORE DELIVERY (Should fail - 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Great product!"
}

###
### STEP 18: LOGIN AS ADMIN TO UPDATE ORDER STATUS
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@ecommerce.com",
  "username": "admin_user",
  "password": "Admin123"
}

### @name adminLogin
# Copy the 'access_token' value and paste below
@admin_token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc4MzEzODE4fQ.tP9Atq8ncbkyqRZ9L_P9erURSMGuBiltuY-XQJDgIqM

###
### STEP 19: UPDATE ORDER TO SHIPPED (Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status?new_status=shipped
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### STEP 20: UPDATE ORDER TO DELIVERED (Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status?new_status=delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### STEP 21: VERIFY ORDER IS DELIVERED
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###
### STEP 22: NOW CREATE REVIEW (Should succeed - 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent quality! Highly recommended!"
}

### @name createReview
# Save review ID
@review_id = 1

###
### STEP 23: GET PRODUCT REVIEWS
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews

###
### STEP 24: VIEW REVIEW WITH AVERAGE RATING
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews?skip=0&limit=10

###
### STEP 25: UPDATE OWN REVIEW
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Very good product, excellent packaging!"
}

###
### STEP 26: VIEW UPDATED REVIEW
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews

###
### STEP 27: ATTEMPT DUPLICATE REVIEW (Should fail - 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 3,
  "comment": "Another review attempt"
}

###
### STEP 28: DELETE REVIEW
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

###
### STEP 29: VERIFY REVIEW DELETED
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews

